    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MURIEL: Darling, please! Children, you'll be late to school. Run along and --\nJOAN: Miss Stellwagon says that functionalism in modern furniture --\nMURIEL: Never mind, dear.",
      "MARY: Will that be all?\nBETSY: \"Forced to sell. Farm dwelling, oak grove, apple orchard, trout stream, hay fields, four barns, original beams --\"",
      "MURIEL: Children, you haven't even seen this house yet.\nBETSY: Personally, I'd like a Crane Mobile home. It comes all folded up and all you do is plug it in for electricity and water and --",
      "BETSY: I think it's awful. Smelling up the house with those horrible chemicals.\nMURIEL: Never mind, Betsy. Dear, I'm going up to the place this afternoon to see about landscaping. Bill's driving me.",
      "JOAN: Bicker, bicker, bicker.\nMURIEL: Another word and you don't get your laboratory.\nBETSY: Well, that's something!"
    ]
  },
